Trimmed real data (ruling T1: Debian package data and popcon are open sources).

- http/Packages.xz: 20 stanzas of Debian 13 (trixie) main binary-amd64
  Packages.xz, https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists/trixie/main/binary-amd64/Packages.xz,
  as published on 2026-09-12. The Maintainer, Filename, Size, MD5sum, SHA256
  and Description-md5 fields were removed, and so was elpa-ligature's
  Homepage (a personal account); nothing else was changed.
- http/by_inst.gz: the header and 24 of the 224,225 rows of the Debian
  Popularity Contest report https://popcon.debian.org/by_inst.gz of
  2026-09-25. Maintainer names of individual people were replaced by
  "(removed)", and the Total row was recomputed for these rows.
- http/all-popcon-results-head.gz: the first four lines of
  https://popcon.debian.org/all-popcon-results.gz of 2026-09-25.
- snapshot/ and expected.jsonl are derived from these files by the collector.

The popcon material and the Debian web site content are available under the
MIT (Expat) License or, at your option, the GNU General Public License,
version 2 or any later version (https://www.debian.org/license). Package
metadata is published by the Debian project (https://www.debian.org/).
